#. type: Plain text
#: pages/members.adoc:9
#| msgid ""
#| "Elected Representative: "
#| "*https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/User:Bookwar[Aleksandra Fedorova]* "
#| "_(f33-f34)_"
msgid ""
"Elected Representative: link:{url_wiki}/User:Bookwar[*Aleksandra Fedorova*] "
"_(f42-f44)_"
msgstr ""
"Vald representant: link:{url_wiki}/User:Bookwar[*Aleksandra Fedorova*] "
"_(f42–f44)_"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/members.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Aleksandra has started contributing to Fedora as a Russian Fedora Ambassador"
" and a member of the Russian Fedora Remix project.  She worked as a Build, "
"Devops, CI and Release Engineer in several projects including Openstack.  "
"She currently works in Red Hat on CentOS and RHEL development "
"infrastructure, and runs CentOS Integration SIG."
msgstr ""
"Aleksandra började bidra till Fedora som rysk Fedora-ambassadör och medlem i"
" projektet Russian Fedora Remix.  Hon har arbetat som ingenjör för bygge, "
"DevOps, CI och utgåvor i flera projekt, bland annat OpenStack.  Hon arbetar "
"nu på Red Hat med utvecklingsinfrastrukturen för CentOS och RHEL och leder "
"CentOS Integration SIG."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/members.adoc:15
#| msgid ""
#| "Elected Representative: "
#| "*https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/User:Bookwar[Aleksandra Fedorova]* "
#| "_(f33-f34)_"
msgid ""
"Elected Representative: link:{url_wiki}/User:Churchyard[*Miro Hrončok*] "
"_(f42-f44)_"
msgstr ""
"Vald representant: link:{url_wiki}/User:Churchyard[*Miro Hrončok*] "
"_(f42–f44)_"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/members.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Miro joined Fedora when he link:{url_wiki}/Features/3D_Printing[packaged the"
" 3D printing stack for Fedora 19] and soon become a "
"link:{url_wiki}/Ambassadors[Fedora Ambassador] and started working in Red "
"Hat as a member of the link:{url_wiki}/User:Python-maint[Python Maintenance "
"team].  Apart form Fedora Council, he is also a member of the "
"link:{url_wiki}/SIGs/Python[Python SIG], "
"link:{url_wiki}/Packaging_Committee[Packaging Committee], provenpackager, "
"packager sponsor, former xref:fesco::index.adoc[Fedora Engineering Steering "
"Committee] member, and a contributing member of the "
"link:https://www.python.org/psf-landing/[Python Software Foundation].  Miro "
"currently maintains around 200 Fedora and/or EPEL packages and the "
"link:https://fedoraproject.org/labs/python-classroom[Fedora Python Classroom"
" Lab].  He also teaches at the link:https://www.cvut.cz/en[Czech Technical "
"University] and often helps with the link:https://pyladies.cz/praha/[Czech "
"PyLadies beginners courses] in Prague.  Miro lives in a small Czech village "
"with his wife, Irish Wolfhounds and ginger cats, growing tomatoes to relax."
msgstr ""
"Miro anslöt sig till Fedora när han "
"link:{url_wiki}/Features/3D_Printing[paketerade 3D-utskriftsstacken för "
"Fedora 19].  Han blev snart link:{url_wiki}/Ambassadors[Fedora-ambassadör] "
"och började arbeta på Red Hat som medlem i link:{url_wiki}/User:Python-"
"maint[Python Maintenance-teamet].  Utöver Fedorarådet är han också medlem i "
"link:{url_wiki}/SIGs/Python[Python SIG], "
"link:{url_wiki}/Packaging_Committee[Packaging Committee], provenpackager, "
"sponsor för paketerare, tidigare medlem i xref:fesco::index.adoc[Fedora "
"Engineering Steering Committee] och bidragande medlem i "
"link:https://www.python.org/psf-landing/[Python Software Foundation].  Miro "
"underhåller nu omkring 200 Fedora- och/eller EPEL-paket samt "
"link:https://fedoraproject.org/labs/python-classroom[Fedora Python Classroom"
" Lab].  Han undervisar också vid link:https://www.cvut.cz/en[Czech Technical"
" University] och hjälper ofta till med link:https://pyladies.cz/praha/[Czech"
" PyLadies beginners courses] i Prag.  Miro bor i en liten tjeckisk by med "
"sin hustru, irländska varghundar och röda katter och odlar tomater för att "
"koppla av."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/members.adoc:23
#| msgid ""
#| "Engineering Representative: "
#| "*https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/User:Dcantrell[David Cantrell]*"
msgid ""
"Engineering Representative: link:{url_wiki}/User:Dcantrell[*Dave Cantrell*]"
msgstr "Teknikrepresentant: link:{url_wiki}/User:Dcantrell[*Dave Cantrell*]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/members.adoc:29
#| msgid ""
#| "David has been involved in the Linux community since the 1997.  He first "
#| "worked on Fedora Core starting with Fedora Core 4 in 2005.  He worked on the"
#| " installation software (anaconda) and related projects for more than 10 "
#| "years.  His current projects focus on developer workflow tools.  He is a "
#| "Fedora Ambassador and a member of the Fedora Engineering Steering Committee."
msgid ""
"Dave has been involved in the Linux community since 1997.  He first worked "
"on Fedora Core starting with Fedora Core 4 in 2005.  He worked on the "
"installation software (anaconda) and related projects for more than 10 "
"years.  His current projects focus on developer workflow tools.  He is a "
"Fedora Ambassador and a member of the Fedora Engineering Steering Committee."
msgstr ""
"Dave har varit aktiv i Linuxgemenskapen sedan 1997.  Han började arbeta med "
"Fedora Core i samband med Fedora Core 4 år 2005.  Han arbetade med "
"installationsprogrammet anaconda och närliggande projekt i mer än tio år.  "
"Hans nuvarande projekt handlar om verktyg för utvecklarnas arbetsflöde.  Han"
" är Fedora-ambassadör och medlem i Fedora Engineering Steering Committee."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/members.adoc:31
#| msgid ""
