msgid ""
"Mindshare Representative: link:{url_wiki}/User:T0xic0der[Akashdeep Dhar]"
msgstr ""
"Mindshare-representant: link:{url_wiki}/User:T0xic0der[Akashdeep Dhar]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/members.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Akashdeep began contributing as the initiative lead of the "
"xref:websites::objective.adoc[Fedora Websites & Apps Team], before moving on"
" to developing and maintaining xref:infra::index.adoc[Fedora Infrastructure]"
" projects as part of the xref:cle::index.adoc[Red Hat Community Linux "
"Engineering] team.  He also contributes to Mentor Summit, Join SIG, "
"link:https://github.com/fedora-infra/tahrir/milestone/2[Badges Revamp], "
"link:https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Initiatives/Git_Forge_Initiative_2025[Forgejo"
" Initiative], and is in the "
"link:https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/f42-elections-"
"results/[Mindshare committee]."
msgstr ""
"Akashdeep började bidra som initiativansvarig för "
"xref:websites::objective.adoc[Fedora Websites & Apps Team] innan han gick "
"vidare till att utveckla och underhålla projekt inom "
"xref:infra::index.adoc[Fedora Infrastructure] som en del av gruppen "
"xref:cle::index.adoc[Red Hat Community Linux Engineering].  Han bidrar också"
" till Mentor Summit, Join SIG, link:https://github.com/fedora-"
"infra/tahrir/milestone/2[Badges Revamp] och "
"link:https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Initiatives/Git_Forge_Initiative_2025[Forgejo"
" Initiative] samt ingår i "
"link:https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/f42-elections-"
"results/[Mindshare committee]."

