#~ msgid ""
#~ "Petr has been an occasional Fedora user since the very beginning and fully "
#~ "involved as a full-time packager since 2010.  Over time he has contributed "
#~ "to a number of SIGs and has worked on various parts of the distribution."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Petr har stundtals varit en Fedoraanvändare sedan första början och helt "
#~ "inblandad som heltidspaketerare sedan 2010.  Över tid har han bidragit till "
#~ "ett antal SIG:ar och har arbetat med olika delar av distributionen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "He is a Red Hatter and, in addition to his Council role, is currently also "
